  "text": "Haan 👍 Oily skin ke liye ₹500 ke andar meri **top recommendation Minimalist 2% Salicylic Acid Face Cleanser** hai—especially agar oiliness ke saath pimples/blackheads bhi hote hain. Isme salicylic acid + LHA hai, aur current price around ₹270–₹285 hai. [beminimalist.co](https://beminimalist.co/products/salicylic-lha-2-cleanser?_pos=9&_sid=5c40da511&_ss=r&utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### [Minimalist 2% Salicylic Acid Face Cleanser]()\n*₹270*\n\n### [Simple Kind To Skin Refreshing Facial Wash]()\n*₹184*\n\n### [The Derma Co Sali-Cinamide Anti-Acne Face Wash]()\n*₹232*\n\n### [Dermatouch Salicylic Acid 2% Face Wash]()\n*₹129*\n\n**Meri ranking:**\n1. 🥇 **Minimalist 2% Salicylic Acid** — oily + acne/blackheads ke liye best overall.\n2. 🥈 **Simple Refreshing Facial Wash** — agar skin oily hai but sensitive hai ya acne zyada nahi hai; current listing ~₹184. [www.ndtvshopping.com](https://www.ndtvshopping.com/beauty-and-grooming/best-face-washes-to-buy-for-indian-skin-oily-dry-dull-and-acne-10899929?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n3. 🥉 **The Derma Co Sali-Cinamide** — oily/acne-prone skin ke liye budget option, ~₹232.\n4. **Dermatouch 2% Salicylic Acid** — very budget option, ~₹129.\n\n**Important:** Agar Minimalist use karoge aur skin dry/irritated hone lage, use frequency kam kar dena. Face wash ke baad lightweight, non-comedogenic moisturizer aur daytime mein sunscreen bhi lagao.\n\nAgar tum mujhe bata do **sirf oily skin hai ya oily + pimples/blackheads bhi hain**, main ₹500 ke andar **exact 1 best face wash** choose kar dunga.",
